\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-180\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \cf0  O God of mercy, God of might,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 In love and pity infinite,
\par Teach us, as ever in Thy sight,
\par To live our life to Thee.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  And Thou, who cam'st on earth to die
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 That fallen man might live thereby,
\par O hear us, for to Thee we cry, -
\par In hope, O Lord, to Thee.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Teach us the lesson Thou hast taught,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj To feel for those Thy blood hath bought,
\par That every word and deed and thought
\par May work a work for thee.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  For all are brethren, far and wide,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Since Thou, O Lord, for all hast died;
\par Then teach us, whatsoe'er betide,
\par To love them all in Thee.
\par \pard\li405\sl190\slmult0 
\par \pard\fi-225\li405\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5.  In sickness, sorrow, want, or care,
\par \pard\li405\sl190\slmult0 Whate'er it be, 'tis ours to share;
\par May we, where help is needed, there
\par Give help as unto Thee.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li405\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6.  And may Thy Holy Spirit move
\par \pard\li405\sl190\slmult0 All those who live, to live in love,
\par Till Thou shall greet in heaven above
\par All those who give to Thee.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li405\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 7\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 7.  And may Thy Holy Spirit move
\par \pard\li405\sl190\slmult0 All those who live, to live in love,
\par Till thou shalt greet in heaven above
\par \pard       All those who give to Thee.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

